[Annotator "https://lichess.org/@/siddharth_08"]
[UTCDate "2021.06.18"]
[UTCTime "16:35:51"]
[Orientation "white"]
[ChapterMode "gamebook"]

{ Repeat what you have learned }
1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 d6 3. f4 Nc6 { Knights out first... } 4. Nf3 Bd7 { Take the full center } 5. d4 cxd4 6. Nxd4 Nf6 { Same as before...Support your knight } 7. Be3 e6 { The opponent is playing Scheveningen. Here you play a specific move.. Qf3 } 8. Qf3 Nxd4 9. Bxd4 Be7 { Get your king to safety } 10. O-O-O O-O { Here you must bring your rooks to the f and g files. Then you should launch your pawns toward the enemy king. } { [%cal Gh1g1,Gg2g4,Gh2h4,Gh4h5,Gg4g5,Gf4f5,Gf1e2,Gd1f1] } *

