{ Repeat what you know }
1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 e5 { Here, just develop your bishop } 3. Bc4 d6 4. d3 { Now your knight } 4... Nc6 5. Nge2 Be7 { f4 } 6. f4 exf4 { Capture with.... } 7. Nxf4 { the knight! } 7... Nf6 8. O-O O-O { You should play this position like a Vienna } *

